# === Engine: Redot / Godot ===
.godot/
*.translation
# Godot's default ignores export_presets.cfg because on some platforms it carries
# signing credentials (Android keystore passwords in particular). Ours is Linux-only
# and holds none, and leaving it untracked is how six sprints passed with NO export
# preset at all — and therefore with two export-fatal defects nobody could see.
# Tracked deliberately so the export path is reproducible and tests/unit/
# export_safety_test.gd guards something real.
# ⚠ If a platform needing credentials is ever added, split them into
# export_credentials.cfg (which Godot writes separately) and ignore THAT, never
# re-ignore this whole file.
!export_presets.cfg
export_credentials.cfg
# GdUnit4 generated test reports (HTML/XML) — regenerated on every run
reports/
# Redot editor binary + local symlink (136 MB — do not commit; each dev supplies their own)
redot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64
/redot
# Uncomment if using Godot:
# *.import

